From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:46:03 +1100
Subject: Friendlier for non-readers: no typing, pictures on Yes/No, more type
 symbols, badge confetti, no forced island trip

- No nickname questions; the name screens open filled in with the cursor on OK
- New game skips the written instruction pages
- Green tick / red cross on Yes/No boxes; nine more attack-type symbols
- HP numbers hidden under the hearts
- Rare Candy teaches new moves without asking which to forget
- Trainer battles never ask 'will you switch?'
- Confetti when a Gym Badge is earned
- Cinnabar Gym quiz doors open; Bill's Sevii Islands trip is not started for the youngest preset
- Navigation: surf only where the goal's route was planned with it

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

